    'Blue:  x + 2y = (' + xs + ') + 2(' + ys + ') = ' + plainNum(state.c) + '  \u2713\n' +
    'Red:   y = ' + plainNum(state.m) + 'x + 3 \u2192 ' + ys + ' = ' + plainNum(state.m) + '(' + xs + ') + 3  \u2713\n\n' +
    'Both statements are true for the same ordered pair, which is exactly what it means to be the solution of the system.';
